% requires: resident-outlines
% expect-output: 5.56
% expect-output: 0.0
% expect-output: true
% divergence: resident-inventory
% Scenario: Unicode fallback. Helvetica re-encoded with code 65 as /Euro
% outlines through the asset's Unicode cmap when the post table has no
% such name, and advances by the AFM's Euro width, 556.
% Expect: 5.56 and 0.0, then true (the path rises above the baseline).
/r { 1000 mul round 1000 div } def
/H2 /Helvetica findfont dup length dict copy
  dup /Encoding StandardEncoding dup length array copy
  dup 65 /Euro put put definefont pop
/H2 findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 moveto (A) false charpath
currentpoint r exch r = =
pathbbox 0 gt exch pop exch pop exch pop =
